#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-newsticker.php
msgid ""
"A Gutenberg block for animated news tickers with scroll, fade, slide and "
"typing animations."
msgstr ""
"Bloc Gutenberg le haghaidh stiallacha nuachta beoite le scrollú, céimniú, "
"sleamhnú agus clóscríobhán."

